                       Wed    Thu    Thu    Fri  

                     Night         Night        



Summit   (14411 FT)     17     14     22     26

                      W 35  NW 30  NW 25  NW 25 



Camp Muir(10188 FT)     33     31     38     41

                      W 25  NW 15  NW 15   N  5 



Paradise  (5420 FT)     40     49     41     59

                      W 15   W 10   N  5   W  5 



