...HEAT ADVISORY IN EFFECT UNTIL 8 PM PDT FRIDAY...



.DISCUSSION...

Dry, hot and hazy weather continues through the end of this week,

with 0% chance for rain. Very low humidity during the afternoons,

with poor to moderate recovery during the nights. Westerly winds 

peak in the mid-afternoon through the early evening. 



