Pueblo Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2022 UTC Wednesday, August  6, 2025



.AVIATION /18Z TAFS THROUGH 18Z THURSDAY/...

Issued at 1147 AM MDT Wed Aug 6 2025

VFR at all taf sites the next 24 hrs. Enough moisture returns to

the area for isolated, high based thunderstorms over mainly the

mountains his afternoon and evening, with most storms producing

gusty/erratic winds but little/no rainfall. While not expecting 

rain to affect the terminals, there could be gusty outflows

from passing storms, and have kept a prob30 group from 21Z-01Z 

at both COS and PUB.





