Apalachicola  76  88  76  87 /  40  60  50  80 



&&



.TAE WATCHES/WARNINGS/ADVISORIES...

FL...None.

GA...Flood Watch until 8 PM EDT this evening for GAZ120>131-142>146.



AL...Flood Watch until 7 PM CDT this evening for ALZ067>069.



GM...None.

&&



