     FM070200 16007KT P6SM SKC PROB30 0709/0713 VRB25G35KT 4SM -TSRA

      BKN100CB=





Hey Walt! 

Tricky forecast as timing the potential thunderstorms is really 

uncertain with little model agreement. I sided with timing close to 

the HRRR/RAP, but my confidence is not high enough at this point to 

go tempo or prevailing.  I have a bit more confidence farther north, 

so I have a tempo in the STJ terminal, but just prob30s in the metro 

tafs. These storms look to be fairly high based, 8-10K, but could 

produce a bit of wind so went ahead and added the gusty conditions 

in as well. 

Looking forward to your input!

Have a wonderful evening!!

~Brad



