.AVIATION...Wednesday 06/18Z through Thursday 07/18Z...VFR

conditions. Localized FU north of KGCN to KPGA. Isolated

-SHRA/-TSRA primarily in Navajo/Apache counties today. Winds are

 SW 10-15 kts gusting up to 25 kts, then light and VRB after 03Z.

 Gusty and erratic winds can be expected near storms.

 

OUTLOOK...Thursday 07/18Z through Saturday 09/18Z...VFR

conditions. Localized FU north of KGCN to KPGA. Daily chances for

-SHRA/-TSRA, primarily across the higher terrain KFGZ and

 southward. Winds are W-SW winds 10-20 kts gusting up to 30 kts.

 Winds are light and VRB during the overnight periods. Gusty and

 erratic winds can be expected near storms.





