     Davis Mountains Foothills-Eastern Culberson-Guadalupe 

     Mountains Above 7000 Feet-Guadalupe and Delaware Mountains-

     Lower Brewster County-Marfa Plateau-Van Horn and Highway 54 

     Corridor.



