Flagstaff Aviation Discussion

Issued at 0003 UTC Thursday, August  7, 2025



.AVIATION...Thursday 07/00Z through Friday 08/00Z...VFR conditions.

Localized FU north of KGCN to KPGA. Isolated -SHRA/-TSRA primarily

in Navajo/Apache counties through 02Z this evening and again after

18Z Thursday. Winds are SW 10-15 kts gusting up to 25 kts, then 

light and VRB after 03Z. SW winds 10-15 kts gusting near 25 kts

will develop again after 17Z Thursday. Gusty and erratic winds 

can be expected near storms.

OUTLOOK...Friday 08/00Z through Sunday 10/00Z...VFR conditions. 

Localized FU north of KGCN to KPGA. Daily chances for -SHRA/-TSRA,

primarily across the higher terrain KFLG-KRQE southward. Winds 

are W-SW winds 10-20 kts gusting up to 30 kts. Winds are light and

VRB during the overnight periods. Gusty and erratic winds can be 

expected near storms.





